# Apptainer definition file for GeoCoT environment.
#
# BUILDTIME: Rocky Linux 9 via Bootstrap:yum.
#   Empty %post = no device creation = no nodev/fakeroot issues.
# RUNTIME: Job script installs Python + CUDA on compute node.
#
# Build environment constraints:
#   - Build node root filesystem is 64MB FUSE (nodev, no space)
#   - Build node GPFS is at /scratch/gpfs/... (different from compute node /home/user/)
#   - Build node has yum but yum repos require network access that may be restricted

Bootstrap: yum
From: rockylinux:9
